      "content": "but that's just what people say to feel better. like, the \"it gets better\" thing. but what if it doesn't? what if some things are just too messed up to ever actually be okay again? i feel like i've spent so long trying to patch myself up and it just keeps breaking. like there's nothing underneath the cracks anymore.",
